- **The proposed {{ . }} to the user MUST be enclosed in a clearly delimited block** so a human can
  identify *exactly* what we would send to the customer, character-for-character. Wrap **only** the
  {{ . }} text between these two fences, on their own lines:
  ```
  --- BEGIN REPLY ---
  <the exact message we would send to the user, in markdown>
  --- END REPLY ---
  ```
  Put nothing else inside the fences — everything outside (the `[OUTBOUND]` header, notes) is context;
  everything *inside* is the verbatim {{ . }}. Use this same block for every DRAFT and every POSTED
  {{ . }} you record.
{{- /* no trailing newline */ -}}